## Skemos security — real-time auditd watch rules for sensitive paths.
## This is a TEMPLATE: __SKEMOS_HOME__ is substituted for the real home
## directory by bootstrap.sh before this is installed to
## /etc/audit/rules.d/skemos.rules and loaded with `augenrules --load`.
## All five rules share ONE key (skemos) so the audit-status job can select
## exactly these events with `ausearch -k skemos` — an unfiltered ausearch
## would also count every login, sudo call and service start on the box.
-w __SKEMOS_HOME__/.ssh -p wa -k skemos
-w /etc/shadow -p wa -k skemos
-w /etc/sudoers.d/ -p wa -k skemos
-w /etc/pacman.d/ -p wa -k skemos
-w /etc/passwd -p wa -k skemos
